- [ ] `research/lineages/luna/deep-research-state.jsonl` holds 3 iteration records
- [ ] `research/research.md` exists and ranks recommendations to improve, refine and expand the feature
- [ ] `validate.sh --strict` prints `RESULT: PASSED` on this phase
<!-- /ANCHOR:completion -->

