.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/SKILL.md:383:7. Use `generate-context.js` for continuity saves. **Owner**: the YAML workflow (`deep_review_{auto,confirm}.yaml`) calls it at the save phase, not the reducer (`scripts/reduce-state.cjs`) directly — don't expect continuity-save side effects from the reducer alone.
